  "slug": "guest-incident-request-form",
  "title": "Guest Incident Request Form",
  "subtitle": "Open a guest incident case and state what is being asked for: follow-up, investigation, property recovery, or routing to the insurer.",
  "description": "An original intake record that opens a guest incident case. It captures who is raising it and on whose behalf, what is being asked of the venue, the facts as reported, urgency triage, the acceptance decision and case routing, unresolved information gaps, and the handoff to the responsible manager.",
  "use_case": "Use when a guest, a companion, or a staff member asks the venue to act on something that happened - an injury, an illness, lost or damaged property, or a service failure - and a case has to be opened and routed. The request closes when the case is accepted and assigned, or declined with a recorded reason.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
  "sections": [
